{"id": "y0439", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The field general began to write out a letter to the king he was told to send what when the enemy was near? Sy llable.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0447", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The best option would be B, neighbor's house. If you don't have any furniture, asking a neighbor is usually the most practical and polite way to borrow something temporary. They might already have extra items they're not using or are willing to lend out. Su gar, an apartment room, and floor aren't places where you typically borrow furniture from. So B makes the most sense in this case.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0455", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sleeping in is the best choice for Alice to enjoy her Friday night without going to bed early.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0463", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is D, go back. When you forget something at home and you' re already on the way to your destination, the most practical thing to do is turn around and head back home to retrieve it. While options like arriving there or turning around might seem relevant, they don't directly address the problem of forgetting something. And obviously, farting isn't a helpful solution in this situation. So, go ing back is the best course of action to solve the issue.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0471", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "George didn't have a car, but he still had his two feet. His socks were smelly and his soles were blistered, but that didn't matter. He could still do what? A: Michigan. Walk. Stay still. St ink. Eat hands.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
